{#
  BeMart Customer-registration-complete page — EC-CUBE
  goCustomerRegistrationComplete.

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 default-theme `Entry/complete.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/default/Entry/complete.twig).

  DATA page (no form) — the data-page recipe (see var/templates/
  README.md). EC-CUBE shows this static confirmation after a successful
  provisional `doRegisterCustomer` (the email-verification-ON branch).
  Markup skeleton, `ec-role` / `ec-pageHeader` / `ec-registerCompleteRole`
  / `ec-reportHeading` / `ec-off3Grid` / `ec-text-ac` /
  `ec-reportDescription` / `ec-off4Grid` classes + the block structure
  are kept verbatim from EC-CUBE.

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml. The
     `front.entry.complete_message__temporary` value is a multi-line YAML
     literal; EC-CUBE prints it through `nl2br`, so the port substitutes
     the literal text verbatim and applies the same `nl2br`.
   - `canonical-url 'homepage')` -> deterministic `/homepage` (BeMartTwigExtension).
#}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% set body_class = 'registration_page' %}
{% set route = 'entry-complete' %}
{% set title = '新規会員登録(仮登録完了)' %}

{% block main %}
    <div class="ec-role">
        <div class="ec-pageHeader">
            <h1>新規会員登録(仮登録完了)</h1>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ec-registerCompleteRole">
        <div class="ec-reportHeading">
            <h2>会員登録ありがとうございます</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ec-off3Grid ec-text-ac">
            <div class="ec-off3Grid__cell">

                <p class="ec-reportDescription">{{ "現在、仮会員の状態です。ただいま、ご入力いただいたメールアドレス宛に、ご本人様確認用のメールをお送りいたしました。\nメール本文内のURLをクリックすると、本会員登録が完了となります。\n"|nl2br }}</p>

            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ec-off4Grid">
            <div class="ec-off4Grid__cell"><a class="ec-blockBtn--cancel" href="/">トップページへ</a></div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
